<template>
  <section aria-label="受控病区床位序列">
    <p v-if="!allowed">当前身份或范围不能读取床位序列。</p>
    <template v-else>
      <p>{{ governance?'超级管理员全院序列审核及冻结审计':'授权科室与实际病区的完整床位序列捕获' }}。历史物理占床、四类事件和未来容量场景分别保留；不从今日病床状态补造历史，也不改床位、住院或实时名额。</p>
      <el-form inline @submit.prevent="page=1;load()">
        <el-form-item label="床位序列科室"><el-select v-model="department" aria-label="床位序列科室" clearable :disabled="!!departmentId||saving" placeholder="明确科室；全院审计可不限定"><el-option v-for="d in departments" :key="d.department_id" :value="d.department_id" :label="`${d.name||'原科室'} · #${d.department_id}`" /></el-select></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="床位序列病区"><el-select v-model="ward" aria-label="床位序列病区" clearable :disabled="!!wardId||!department||saving" placeholder="明确实际病区，不默认首项"><el-option v-for="w in options?.wards||[]" :key="w.ward_id" :value="w.ward_id" :label="`${w.name||'原病区'} · #${w.ward_id}`" /></el-select></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="床位序列治理状态"><el-select v-model="status" aria-label="床位序列治理状态" clearable><el-option v-for="(label,value) in bedSourceStates" :key="value" :value="value" :label="label" /></el-select></el-form-item>
        <el-button native-type="submit" :loading="loading">查询受控床位序列</el-button><el-button @click="sourcesOpen=true">登记或治理三类床位原来源</el-button>
      </el-form>
      <p v-if="error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p><p v-if="notice" role="status">{{ notice }}</p>
      <template v-if="canRecord">
        <el-card shadow="never">
          <p>先明确连续 112..366 个已闭合业务日，服务器核验截止日及实际 IANA 日界。首次只读预览不会创建序列。</p>
          <el-input v-model="timezone" aria-label="床位序列IANA时区" placeholder="明确原业务时区" :disabled="saving" /><el-input v-model="dateFrom" aria-label="床位序列开始业务日" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" :disabled="saving" /><el-input v-model="dateTo" aria-label="床位序列截止业务日" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" :disabled="saving" />
          <el-button :disabled="saving||!periodValid" :loading="previewing" @click="preview">读取完整相关来源及实际日界</el-button>
          <template v-if="candidate"><series-form :key="candidate.collection_digest" ref="editor" :period="period" :preview="candidate" :disabled="saving" @validity="formValid=$event" @inspect="inspectSource" /><el-button type="primary" :loading="saving" :disabled="saving||!formValid" @click="capture">捕获全部成员并保存待审核序列</el-button></template>
        </el-card>
      </template>
      <el-table :data="items" aria-label="受控床位序列元数据目录" v-loading="loading"><el-table-column label="序列原标识与范围" min-width="280"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.series_id }}<br />科室 #{{ row.department_id }} · 病区 #{{ row.ward_id }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="created_at" label="原冻结登记UTC" min-width="230" /><el-table-column label="原治理及当前资格" min-width="230"><template #default="{row}">{{ bedSourceStates[row.status] }} v{{ row.revision }}<br />{{ row.eligible?'当前可提交固定预测':'当前不可新运行' }}<br /><el-button @click="inspect(row)">核对完整床位序列</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table>
      <p>共 {{ total }} 件；目录仅元数据。来源变化、期间到期或算法变化均需重新核对，不恢复失效来源正文。</p><el-pagination v-if="total>20" v-model:current-page="page" :total="total" :page-size="20" layout="prev,pager,next" @current-change="load" />
    </template>
    <el-dialog v-model="detailOpen" title="完整床位序列冻结核对与治理" width="min(1150px,97vw)" @closed="!detailOpen&&clearDetail()">
      <p v-if="detailError" role="alert">{{ detailError }}</p>
      <template v-if="allowed&&detail">
        <p class="hash">{{ detail.source_id }}<br />原科室 #{{ detail.department_id }} · 原病区 #{{ detail.ward_id }}<br />资料可用截止UTC {{ detail.as_of }}<br />原冻结登记UTC {{ detail.created_at }} · 原作者 #{{ detail.created_by }}<br />完整原件 {{ detail.content_hash }}<br />完整集合 {{ detail.collection_digest }}<br />公开投影 {{ detail.projection_hash??'尚未发布' }}<br />当前治理 {{ detail.governance_hash }} · {{ bedSourceStates[detail.status] }} v{{ detail.revision }}</p>
        <p>全集合当前性 {{ detail.source_current?'一致':'失效' }}；{{ detail.eligible?'当前可提交固定预测，仍不是运营效果验证':'当前不能用于新运行' }}。{{ detail.exclusion_reasons.join('；') }}</p>
        <template v-if="detail.snapshot">
          <p v-if="detail.audit_only&&!detail.eligible">以下仅超级管理员独立冻结审计，不能恢复旧来源作新运行。</p>
          <p>原期间 {{ detail.snapshot.request.date_from }} 至 {{ detail.snapshot.request.date_to }} · {{ detail.snapshot.request.business_timezone }}；完整 {{ detail.snapshot.request.days.length }} 天、{{ detail.snapshot.facts.length }} 件来源。当前预测分析尚未在本面板运行。</p>
          <p>五个独立目标原声明：<span v-for="c in detail.snapshot.request.target_coverage" :key="c.target">{{ bedTargets[c.target] }}（{{ c.same_scope_confirmed }}/{{ c.same_definition_confirmed }}/{{ c.same_method_confirmed }}）；</span></p>
          <el-button @click="showFrozen=!showFrozen">{{ showFrozen?'收起':'展开' }}院内完整冻结原件</el-button><pre v-if="showFrozen" aria-label="院内完整床位序列原件">{{ JSON.stringify(detail.snapshot,null,2) }}</pre>
          <el-button v-if="detail.public_source" @click="showPublic=!showPublic">{{ showPublic?'收起':'展开' }}固定服务公开投影</el-button><pre v-if="showPublic" aria-label="床位序列固定服务公开投影">{{ JSON.stringify(detail.public_source,null,2) }}</pre>
          <p>完整原范围、原件自由依据、原外部登记键仅院内核对。固定服务只接收公开投影；即时名额不替代可运营物理总床数，未来场景不冒充已观察事实。</p>
          <el-button v-if="detail.eligible" @click="emit('select',detail)">选择此已发布床位序列</el-button>
        </template><p v-else>原件、公开投影及自由治理备注当前已隐藏，仅保留当前治理元数据。</p>
        <p v-if="detail.reviewed_at">原审核UTC {{ detail.reviewed_at }} · 原审核人 #{{ detail.reviewed_by }}<br />{{ detail.review_basis_note }}</p><p v-if="detail.revoked_at">原撤销UTC {{ detail.revoked_at }} · 原撤销人 #{{ detail.revoked_by }}<br />{{ detail.revoke_reason }}</p>
        <template v-if="canReview"><el-input v-model="reviewBasis" aria-label="床位序列审核依据" type="textarea" placeholder="明确完整成员、逐日选择和五目标声明；至少20非空白字符且不超过4000 UTF8字节" /><el-button :disabled="acting||!bedReviewBasisValid(reviewBasis)" :loading="acting" @click="act('publish')">审核并发布完整床位序列</el-button><el-button :disabled="acting||!bedReviewBasisValid(reviewBasis)" :loading="acting" @click="act('reject')">审核并拒绝完整床位序列</el-button></template>
        <template v-if="detail.can_revoke===true"><el-input v-model="revokeReason" aria-label="床位序列撤销依据" type="textarea" /><el-button type="danger" :disabled="acting||!revokeValid" :loading="acting" @click="act('revoke')">撤销此完整床位序列</el-button></template>
      </template>
    </el-dialog>
    <el-dialog v-model="sourceOpen" title="序列候选原件核对" width="min(1000px,96vw)" @closed="!sourceOpen&&clearSource()"><p v-if="sourceError" role="alert">{{ sourceError }}</p><template v-if="sourceDetail"><p class="hash">{{ sourceDetail.source_id }} · {{ sourceDetail.status }} v{{ sourceDetail.revision }}<br />观察UTC {{ sourceDetail.payload?.observed_at??'未提供或未来场景' }}<br />原系统登记UTC {{ sourceDetail.recorded_at }} · 原审核UTC {{ sourceDetail.reviewed_at??'尚未审核' }}</p><pre aria-label="完整床位候选原件">{{ JSON.stringify(sourceDetail,null,2) }}</pre></template></el-dialog>
    <el-dialog v-model="sourcesOpen" title="三类床位原来源登记与治理" width="97vw" destroy-on-close><bed-sources v-if="sourcesOpen&&allowed" :department-id="department" :ward-id="ward" :governance="governance" :active="sourcesOpen&&active" @source-changed="sourceChanged" /></el-dialog>
  </section>
</template>

<script setup>
import {computed,defineAsyncComponent,onActivated,onBeforeUnmount,onDeactivated,ref,watch} from 'vue';
import {useStore} from 'vuex';
